Spring Boot Form Validator

A simple Spring Boot application for server-side form validation using Thymeleaf and Hibernate Validator.

🚀 Features
.) Server-side form validation
.) Required field validation with @NotBlank
.) Input length validation with @Size
.)Validation error messages
.)Thymeleaf form integration
.)Spring MVC request handling

🛠️ Technologies
Java 21
Spring Boot 4.1.0
Spring Web MVC
Thymeleaf
Spring Validation
Hibernate Validator
Maven

📂 Project Structure
src/
├── main/
│   ├── java/              # Java source code
│   └── resources/
│       ├── templates/     # Thymeleaf HTML files
│       └── application.properties
└── test/                  # Test code

pom.xml                    # Maven configuration

🎯 Purpose
This project demonstrates how to implement server-side validation in Spring Boot and display validation errors through a Thymeleaf form.
